{"ID":"20240118151027-93b1i7h","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151027-93b1i7h","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151027-93b1i7h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151027-xr2cka1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122151606-51oe5cl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122151606-51oe5cl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"273莨菪子","type":"doc","updated":"20240124115607"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151027-xr2cka1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151027-xr2cka1","updated":"20240122151558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，有毒。治齿痛、出虫，肉痹拘急。使人健行、见鬼。多食令人狂走。久服轻身、走及奔马。强志，益力，通神。生海滨、川谷。一名横唐。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122151605-2h3z1qw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151605-2h3z1qw"}},{"ID":"20240122151606-51oe5cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122151606-51oe5cl","updated":"20240122151610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二百七十三，莨菪子，菪，第二个字念dang，LangDang，这个药是根入药，这个药现在我们也是用的不多。诸位看桔梗长的样子，桔梗，张仲景用得很凶。"}]}]}